                                                "sense_id": "77583937-41b9-3ca9-b785-6401ac3a1ab5",
                                                "text": "This conclusion will certainly be strengthened by reading the accusatory speech composed by Deinarchus […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f82e476-4ec7-4a6f-be39-02a19a8bd950",
                                                "sense_id": "77583937-41b9-3ca9-b785-6401ac3a1ab5",
                                                "text": "Had she heard the same Bob Dylan singing “The Lonesome Death of Hattie Carroll,” his accusatory song about the fatal caning of a 51-year-old black barmaid by a young white patrician, “The Help” might have ventured outside its harsh yet still comfortable, reader-friendly world."
                                            }
